	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Genome-wide CRISPR screen of rituximab induced cell depletion</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">We screened the genome of OCI-Ly-7, a Diffuse Large B-cell Lymphoma cell line, for genes mediating the response to rituximab treatment. We utilized the genome-wide library GeCKO v2 (A+B) from Feng Zhang. (Addgene#1000000049)</Item>
